  "description": {
   "en": "Despite having doubts about the Public Security Intelligence Agency, which lacks arrest powers and the ability to carry firearms, You Hazuki goes ahead with a job interview. One day, he hears a rumor that a professor he admires is somehow involved with an extremist group. Determined to uncover the truth, he heads to the source and ends up witnessing a crucial event—'Information' is the key to saving Japan!",
   "ja": "逮捕権も無い、拳銃も所持できない公安調査庁に疑問を持ちつつも就職面接を受けた葉月陽。ある日、尊敬する教授が過激派組織と関わりがあるという噂を耳にする。その真偽を確かめに向かった先で、ある場面に遭遇し――“情報”が日本を救う!!"
  },
